N54° 09.160’ W113° 38.302’&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Well, Clyde turned out to be my 300th cap and it has sure taken me a long time to get here. It has been a blast for sure and we have been too many fabulous locations which we may not have ever visited. So, now it is off to #301 in Athabasca.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for all this wonderful moving virtual cache ofth, it is much appreciated.&lt;/p&gt;

